2027-01-04T20:52:53  message   To the owner:
For Lisbon in March - mild but changeable:

- Light rain jacket or packable shell + small umbrella
- Layers: light sweaters / fleece, long-sleeve shirts, 1-2 t-shirts
- Comfortable walking shoes with grip for hills and cobbles (plus one nicer pair if you want)
- Jeans / long pants, no heavy winter gear
- Scarf and light jacket for breezy evenings by the river
- Daypack, sunglasses, sunscreen
- EU power adapter if you need one

March usually sits in the 50s-60s F, with sun one hour and showers the next, so layers + rain cover matter more than warmth. Want me to tailor this for carry-on only or checked?

