If you mean August 2027 and you're traveling March 2027, you'd have about 5 months left on return - so you technically meet the 3-month rule.

Caveat: a lot of airlines and travel advisories still recommend 6 months buffer, so with ~5 months you might get warnings at check-in. Since it's only January, you have plenty of time to renew now and avoid any stress.

If you want, tell me your citizenship and the exact expiry date and I'll confirm precisely.

